// Suspicious Hyper-V Cmdlets | T1564.006 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_susp_hyper_v_condlet.yml
ScriptBlockText:(*New\-VM* OR *Set\-VMFirmware* OR *Start\-VM*)

